---
title: 一個 Request 進來後的三條路徑 (Request Lifecycle)
---
flowchart LR
    USER["👤 Client"]:::ext
    LB["@@googlecloud|22@@ <b>Ingress · LB</b><br/>挑一個 backend pod"]:::edge
    BE["@@fastapi|26@@ <b>Backend Pod</b><br/>單一 request<br/>全程在這一個 pod"]:::appcore

    REDIS["@@redis|26@@ <b>Redis</b><br/>buffer + cache"]:::redis
    DRAIN["⚙️ <b>Drainer</b><br/>每 2s flush"]:::worker
    PGB["@@postgresql|22@@ <b>PgBouncer</b>"]:::proxy
    PRIM["@@postgresql|26@@ <b>PRIMARY</b>"]:::dbprim
    REP["@@postgresql|26@@ <b>READ REPLICA</b>"]:::dbrep

    USER -->|HTTPS| LB --> BE
    BE -->|"① 讀: 先查快取 (5s)"| REDIS
    BE ==>|"② 報平安寫: 即回 200"| REDIS
    BE ==>|"③ 一般寫 (建/改事件)"| PGB
    BE -.->|"降級: Redis 掛→直寫"| PGB
    REDIS -->|"SCAN 待刷"| DRAIN
    REDIS -.->|"cache miss"| REP
    DRAIN ==>|"batch UPDATE"| PGB
    PGB --> PRIM
    PRIM -. "replication" .-> REP

    classDef ext fill:#F1F5F9,stroke:#64748B,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#0F2A43;
